    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><span style=\"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">以一个动作，你可以挥舞这张卡片并用其施放<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.QMldyRXZFRZJpA5b]{异界探知contact other plane}</em>。以此方式施放法术时，你的问题将由卡片上所描绘的神秘人物回答。这一特性一经使用，直到次日黎明之前无法再次使用。</span></p><p>As an action, you can brandish this card and use it to cast the @spell[Contact Other Plane] spell. When you cast the spell in this way, your questions are answered by the mysterious figure depicted on the card. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></div>",
